---
import { ShieldCheck, Compass, Lightbulb, Users, ArrowRight } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-900 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <ShieldCheck class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-800" />
        <span>Institutional Mandate</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        A recognized university ecosystem connecting students with the digital and business frontier.
      </h2>

      <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        The <strong>University of Sahiwal</strong> is educating thousands of ambitious minds across Punjab. However, conventional academic curricula often isolate software engineering from commercial distribution, and business case studies from applied technical execution.
      </p>

      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-5 py-2 bg-slate-50 rounded-r-xl text-slate-800 text-sm sm:text-base italic leading-relaxed">
        "Our mission is to empower students across disciplines to develop entrepreneurial mindsets, explore emerging technologies, transform ideas into meaningful ventures, and build the skills and connections needed to create real-world impact."
      </blockquote>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Inspired by the operational models of tier-one university ecosystems like the <em>LUMS Entrepreneurial Society (LES)</em>, <em>IBA Center for Entrepreneurial Development</em>, and <em>Harvard Innovation Labs</em>, we treat student initiatives as serious ventures.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm space-y-5">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
        <span>Department Pathways</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono font-normal text-slate-500">All Faculties Welcome</span>
      </h3>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-xs text-blue-950">Computer Science & IT</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 font-medium">Technical Core</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Move past classroom coding exercises. Build deployable SaaS products, collaborate via GitHub pull requests, and master software architecture.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-xs text-amber-950">BBA, Commerce & Economics</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-medium">Commercial Strategy</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Test business plans in the real world. Run user discovery, financial unit economics, digital client acquisition, and pitch decks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-xs text-emerald-950">English, Law & Social Sciences</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-medium">Design & Comms</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Master professional copywriting, tech policy, community leadership, and executive presentation—critical roles in any successful team.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
